API - Application Programming Interface

Types of API:
RESTful API - reprsentational State Transfer
SOAP - Alternative to set (uses XML to transfer the data)
GraphQl - Instead of multiple endpoints it just exposes only one end point
gRPC - remote procedure call - Uses Protocol buffers instead of Json - Great for Microservice Application
WebSocket - It is a bidirectional channel- Used in the realtime Application


Json - JavaScript Object Notation
ex:
{
    "Name":"XYZ",
    "Age":10
